--- Terms of Use & Rate Limit Summary from Provider ---
Open-Meteo API Terms: Free for non-commercial and open research use with attribution.
Rate limits: Up to 10,000 daily API calls per IP without API key; up to 5,000 calls per hour.
Spatial resolution: ~0.25 degrees (~11 km - 25 km depending on numerical model e.g., GFS / ECMWF).
Time resolution: Hourly (1-hour discrete intervals).

